# macleanup-docs — environment template
#
# 🔴 THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. Never commit a real .env or a real value here.
#    Placeholders only. Real values live in the repo's GitHub Actions secrets
#    (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions) and in ~/.secrets/ locally.
#
# EVERY key below is OPTIONAL. The build must never require one: each provider
# is gated on its own key, so an absent key skips that provider entirely — no
# script tag, no SDK init, no error. `yarn build` succeeds with this file empty.

# [OPTIONAL] Google Analytics 4 measurement id. Absent ⇒ no analytics at all.
GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# [OPTIONAL] Microsoft Clarity project id. Absent ⇒ no session recording.
CLARITY_PROJECT_ID=
